---
import Contact from '@/layouts/sections/Contact.astro';
import Section from "@/components/Section";
import Container from '@/components/Container.astro';
import DefaultLayout from '@/layouts/DefaultLayout.astro';
import Page from '@/layouts/Page.astro';
---

<Page title="About" description="About me">
  <DefaultLayout>
    <Container>
      <Section id="about">
        <Section.Title id="about">About Me</Section.Title>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 mt-4 gap-6">
          - First time with Java back in 2009 in 9th grade (playing around with https://projecteuler.net/)
          - Then HTML stuff and figuring out you could make dynamic pages with a funny little languages called PHP
          - Making a vehicle list website that received around 166,000 first-time visitors and 582,000 pageviews over the course of a year.
            - People were needing that information to complete an "enter all vehicles"-type XBox achievement and it was the only place on the entire internet with the information to do that.
            - My first experience with the internet being a powerful place.
            - Can check it out here: https://web.archive.org/web/20100412025656/http://petera94.co.cc:80/justcause2/vehiclelist.php?type=bike
          - Then did a masters degree in Software Engineering
          - Then working corporate job for a number of years
            - For example involved with an IoT project for a Danish municipality, a pilot project for a danish govermental agency that ended up being picked up at the EU-level, and sat with critical log-in infrastructure.  
          - Now doing freelance and open source work
        </div>
      </Section>
      <Section id="technologies">
        <Section.Title id="technologies">Technologies I Work With</Section.Title>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 mt-4 gap-6">
          I have been and am doing all sorts of stuff with many many different frameworks, languages and technologies picking up and learning stuff as I've gone along.
            - All sorts of stuff, for example doing a project the university's supercomputer in 2017.
        </div>
      </Section>
      <Section id="technologies">
        <Section.Title id="technologies">What Else I Am Up To</Section.Title>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 mt-4 gap-6">
          Product photography
          Railway enthusiast and simulator stuff
        </div>
      </Section>
      <Contact id="contact" title="Contact" />
    </Container>
  </DefaultLayout>
</Page>